CONSID.P:
Whereas Council Decision 79/542/EEC
OJ No L 146, 14. 6. 1979, p. 15. , as last amended by Commission Decision 97/160/EC
OJ No L 62, 4. 3. 1997, p. 39. , draws up a list of third countries from which the Member States authorize imports of meat products;

Whereas, for many of the countries on that list the animal health and veterinary certification requirements for importation of meat products have been laid down in Commission Decision 91/449/EEC
OJ No L 240, 29. 8. 1991, p. 28. , as last amended by Decision 96/92/EC
OJ No L 21, 27. 1. 1996, p. 71. ;
